        "basis": "Sealed cause and rubric (sha256 893565b9aea09ad933cad0508b00a29a9b90c1d698d2ab90229aa73a6a9f6db2). Partly correct: the CDP adapter conclusion was corrected to the later source and the reproduction is runnable, but the records support 'Playwright has no deadline' and reject the 30 s deadline that closeOrKill in browserType.js implements; the decisive code lay beyond the saved excerpts and was not read.",
